3c.	 Total	qualification	time

Total	qualification	time	(TQT)	is	the	total	amount	of
time,	in	hours,	expected	to	be	spent	by	a	learner
to	achieve	a	qualification.	It	includes	both	guided
learning	hours	and	hours	spent	in	preparation,	study,

and	assessment.	The	total	qualification	time	for	GCSE
English Literature is 140 hours. The total guided
learning	time	is	120-140	hours.

