+      "truth": "On the Origin of Species set out evolution by natural selection but did not present a human-evolution argument; Darwin addressed human evolution directly in The Descent of Man (1871).",
+      "evidence": "Primary text context; Darwin, On the Origin of Species (1859) and The Descent of Man (1871).",
