+      "truth": "Hyde’s trampling of the child in Chapter 1 is already a clear act of violence; Carew’s murder is an escalation.",
+      "evidence": "Primary text ch. 1, lines 281–303; ch. 4, lines 1413–1427.",
+      "verdict": "FIX"
