+      "claim": "‘a death warrant written legibly upon his face… he had his death-warrant written there’",
+      "truth": "The exact line is ‘He had his death-warrant written legibly upon his face.’",
+      "evidence": "Primary text ch. 6, line 2125.",
+      "verdict": "FIX"
+    },
+    {
+      "id": "F11",
