+    "lesson": 7,
+    "field": "exam_tip_html",
+    "find": "<p data-narration-id=\"n17\">OCR marks AO1, AO2, and AO3 holistically. The best responses weave all three into every paragraph. For <em>Jekyll and Hyde</em>, this is natural: a quotation about Hyde’s appearance (AO2) connects to duality theme (AO1) and Darwinian context (AO3) all at once.</p>",
+    "replace": "<p data-narration-id=\"n17\">Strong responses build a critical argument, support it with references, analyse Stevenson’s methods and use relevant context. Write accurately throughout because spelling, punctuation, grammar, vocabulary and sentence structure are also assessed in this section.</p>",
+    "severity": "HIGH",
+    "note": "F27: Use a numberless objectives line and include accurate writing."
+  },
