+    "replace": "<p data-narration-id=\"n17\">Strong responses build a critical argument, support it with references, analyse Stevenson’s methods and use relevant context. Write accurately throughout because spelling, punctuation, grammar, vocabulary and sentence structure are also assessed in this section.</p>",
