+      "claim": "two documents ... the reader ... does not yet know why Jekyll’s body is Hyde’s",
+      "truth": "Several enclosures fall from Jekyll’s envelope, including the revised will, a note and his confession. The body is Hyde’s; Jekyll has disappeared.",
+      "evidence": "Primary text ch. 8, lines 3161–3175 and 3315–3387.",
+      "verdict": "FIX"
+    },
