+      "lesson": 4,
+      "field": "content_html",
+      "severity": "HIGH",
+      "claim": "wakes in a park one morning as Hyde without taking it",
+      "truth": "After the Carew murder, Jekyll transforms while awake on a bench in Regent’s Park. The earlier involuntary awakening as Hyde happens in his own bed before the murder.",
